The '''Barracks of Heroes''' are a sub-location of the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} within the {{Zone|Royal Palace}}.

== Purpose ==
The {{NPCSprite|Royal Resident}} can be found in the bedroom in the '''Barracks of Heroes'''. There is also a {{NPCSprite|Castle Guard}} next to entrance to the Barracks.

The [[Dark Monolith]] can also be found behind the table in the middle room on the 1st floor.

